Subject: [PATCH v2 3/4] ASoC: rsnd: gen: rsnd_gen_ops cares .probe and .remove
User-Agent: Wanderlust/2.14.0 Emacs/23.3 Mule/6.0
MIME-Version: 1.0 (generated by SEMI 1.14.6 - "Maruoka")
